flowchart TD
    Start([Start: prompt language, context]) --> ValidateInput[Validate input<br/>language & context]
    ValidateInput --> GetData[Get data from database]
    GetData --> LOCTranslation[Update LOC according to user language<br/>Translate all content]
    LOCTranslation --> PrepareSystemPrompt[Prepare system prompt<br/>Get SYSTEM_PROMPT template]
    PrepareSystemPrompt --> CombineContext[Combine system prompt<br/>with context data]
    CombineContext --> FormatRequest[Format request payload<br/>model, system, prompt, stream]
    FormatRequest --> SendToModel[Request to chatbot service]
    SendToModel --> QwenModel[Model Qwen2.5:7b]
    QwenModel --> CheckData{Data exists?}
    CheckData -->|No data| ReturnNoData[Return: No data available]
    ReturnNoData --> End([End])
    CheckData -->|Has data| StreamResponse[Stream response<br/>firstValueFrom Observable]
    StreamResponse --> ReturnResult[Return result stream]
    ReturnResult --> FrontendDisplay[Frontend displays the answer<br/>Render streaming response]
    FrontendDisplay --> End([End])
